---------------------------------------------
-> Data Binding (Ways to Data Transfer)
---------------------------------------------

                                 DATA BINDING
                                      │
                   ┌──────────────────┼─────────────────┐
                   ↓                  ↓                 ↓
               TS → HTML          HTML → TS          TS ↔ HTML
                   │                  │                 │
            Interpolation       Event Binding     Two-Way Binding
                   │
           Property Binding

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
| Binding              | Direction   |  Syntax  |      Example        |
| -------------------- | ----------- | -------- | ------------------- |
| Interpolation        | TS → HTML   |  {{ }}   |  {{name}}           |
| Property Binding     | TS → HTML   |   [ ]    |  [src]="imageUrl"   |
| Event Binding        | HTML → TS   |   ( )    |  (click)="save()"   |
| Two-Way Binding      | TS ↔ HTML   |  [( )]   |  [(ngModel)]="name" |
-----------------------------------------------------------------------


Data Interpolation: Data from Typescript -> html
-------------------
            Interpolation
             {{ name }}
                 ↓
            Display as text


Property Binding: Data from Typescript -> html
------------------
              [src]="imageUrl"
                     ↓
            Bind to DOM property




